"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([[884],{21045:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"functions":[],"properties":[],"types":[],"name":"ScalingButton","desc":"Watcher for the `ScalingButton` tag: gives any legacy `GuiButton` a\\nhover-grow and press-shrink animation without a line of code per button.\\n\\nRegistered by [CollectionWatcherController] at boot. Tag a button in\\nStudio and it animates; nothing else is required.\\n\\n### Behavior\\n\\n* `MouseEnter` \u2014 tweens to `HoverScale` (default 1.2) of the button\'s\\n  original size, over `TweenInTime`\\n* `MouseLeave` \u2014 back to the original size, over `TweenOutTime`\\n* `InputBegan` with MouseButton1 or Touch \u2014 down to `ActivatedScale`\\n  (default 0.9), over `TweenInTime`\\n* `InputEnded` \u2014 back to the hover size if the pointer is still over the\\n  button, otherwise the original size, over `InputEndTweenTime`\\n\\nEnter and press are both gated on `button.Active`, so an inactive button\\nstays inert. Leave and release are not, so a button deactivated mid-hover\\nstill settles back. Every branch skips the tween when the button is\\nalready at the target size.\\n\\nOnly the `Scale` components of the button\'s `UDim2` are multiplied \u2014\\n`Offset` is left alone, so buttons sized in pixels do not animate.\\n\\n### Attributes\\n\\nAll optional, read once per button when the handler first runs. Changing\\nthem afterwards has no effect.\\n\\n| Attribute | Default |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| `HoverScale` | 1.2 |\\n| `ActivatedScale` | 0.9 |\\n| `TweenTime` | 0.1 \u2014 the fallback for the three below |\\n| `TweenInTime` | `TweenTime` |\\n| `TweenOutTime` | `TweenTime` |\\n| `InputEndTweenTime` | `TweenOutTime` |\\n\\n:::note\\nThe original size is captured on first run, so a button whose size is\\ndriven by something else after registration will animate around a stale\\nbase. This watcher only covers legacy rbxmx buttons; React buttons handle\\ntheir own hover states.\\n:::\\n\\nCopyright (c) 2026 firebit. All rights reserved.\\nfirebit/survival-islands - proprietary and confidential.","realm":["Client"],"source":{"line":53,"path":"src/Client/Features/CollectionWatcher/Watchers/ScalingButton.luau"}}')}}]);